text = "LEVEL 3: CASTLE INFILTRATION

Story: Infiltrate the Demontek castle, defeat Goliath,
then face the King on the terrace!

Floor 1 (Ground): Normal Demonteks
Floor 2: Mutant Demonteks (stronger!)
Floor 3: GOLIATH BOSS (200 HP, 20 damage)
Terrace: KING DEMONTEK FINAL BOSS (500 HP, 30 damage)

Death sends you back to Floor 1!

This is a placeholder level structure.
Add proper castle backgrounds and boss arenas next!"
